{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"28日\n2期生の誕生日だったのね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/30/9029531/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い2期ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後輩だから可愛いんじゃなくて\n普通に可愛いなと見とれます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヲタ目線だと言われればもう\nなにも否定できないです、はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当時の自分のブログを見てたら\nライブレポがありました(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前も中田は中田でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも行くカフェは決まってるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n全然決まってないけど\n出没率の高いカフェとかは\nいくつかあるよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/30/9029531/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『気づいたら片想い』の\nイヤリングは両耳付けてるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nうん！\nうまズキッ！のとき\n髪で片方隠れちゃってたよね〜(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/30/9029531/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりん\n「生まれたままで」のMVのときの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/30/9029531/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"33色のラブストーリー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話し忘れちゃったってかたに朗報です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1週間って短い期間で\n3週にわたって「友達編」「告白編」「恋人編」順番に公開してたけど\nこの度\n期間限定で全編を一挙に公開しちゃってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただし\n明日31日のお昼までなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞き逃してた とか\nもう一回！ とか\n1週間あけないで3つ聞きたい とか\nってかたは今すぐかけるしか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://r.dwango.jp/b50WzUU3"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目覚ましアラームボイス＆オリジナルボイスが配信されちゃってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/30/9029531/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://r.dwango.jp/4G00yMc3"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言うのすごい遅くなっちゃったから\nもうダウンロードしてるかたもいるかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちはダウンロードしたら毎日聞けるよーん＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったらこれで\n朝、目を覚ましてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/30/9029531/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田情弱すぎて\nコメント読んでて知りました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知遅くなりましてすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/30/9029531/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}